        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">In the injection moulding machine recycling process, the end-of-life machines are colected at the source, transported to the recycler and end-of-life treated entirely, in a combination of material recycling, energetic recovery and landfilling of the remaining waste. The cradle-to-gate production chains of all consumables are included, and credits for the recovered materials are included as well.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
            <technologicalApplicability xml:lang="en">Provision of a standard tend-of-life treatment for injection moulding machines.</technologicalApplicability>
        </technology>
